@startuml Выполнение автоматизации по событию устройства
title Выполнение автоматизации по событию устройства\n(AutomationOrchestratorService)

queue "Event Bus" as Bus
participant "EventConsumer" as Consumer
participant "ScenarioEngine" as Engine
participant "Trigger" as Trigger
participant "Condition" as Condition
participant "Action" as Action
participant "DeviceIntegrationGateway" as DIG

Bus -> Consumer : DeviceEvent\n{deviceId, eventType, value}
activate Consumer
Consumer -> Engine : processEvent(DeviceEvent)
activate Engine

Engine -> Engine : findActiveScenarios(eventType)
Engine -> Trigger : evaluate(DeviceEvent)
activate Trigger
Trigger --> Engine : matched: bool
deactivate Trigger

alt триггер сработал и условия выполнены
    Engine -> Condition : checkAll(DeviceEvent)
    activate Condition
    Condition --> Engine : passed: bool
    deactivate Condition

    Engine -> Action : execute()
    activate Action
    Action --> Engine : DeviceCommand\n{deviceId, commandType, payload}
    deactivate Action

    Engine -> DIG : sendCommand(DeviceCommand)
    activate DIG
    DIG --> Engine : accepted
    deactivate DIG
else триггер не сработал или условие не выполнено
    Engine -> Engine : событие пропускается
end

deactivate Engine
deactivate Consumer
@enduml
